{title: Aankhon Se Tune Ye Kya Keh Diya}
{artist: Kumar Sanu Alka Yagnik}
{key: Am}

{c: Verse 1}
[Am] Aankho Se Tune Ye Kya Keh [E] Diya,        [E] Dil Ye Deewana Dhadakne [Am] Laga
[Am] Tanhai Me Hum Mile Is [E] Tarah,        [E] Barish Me Shola [Am] Bhadak Ne Laga
Tu [Dm] Tadap Ne Laga Mai [C] Machal Ne Lagi
Boond [Dm] Tan Pe Giri Jaan [C] Machal Ne Lagi,        Chha [F] Raha Hai Ajab Sa [E] Nasha
[Am] Thodi Sardi Bhi [Dm] Hai,        [Dm] Thodi Garmi Bhi [Am] Hai
[Am] Thodi Hai Be [E] basi,        [G] Thodi Marzi Bhi [Am] Hai
[A] Aise Mein Hum [Dm] Bhala,        [G] Kya Karen Tu [Am] Bata
[A] Jo Bhi Hota Hai [Dm] Woh,        [G] Hone De Dil [Am] Rubaa
[Am] Aankhon Se Toone...        [Am] Paas Aaun Jo [Dm] Maein
[Dm] Dil Yeh Darta Hai [Am] Kyun,        [Am] Door Jayega [E] Tu
[G] Aisa Lagta Hai [Am] Kyun,        [A] Maine Waada [Dm] Kiya,
[G] Maine Li Hai [Am] Kasam,        [A] Umr Bhar Na [Dm] Kabhie,
[G] Pyar Hoga Yeh [Am] Kam,        [Am] Aankhon Se Toone...
